{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2020-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1600214400, "end_date": 1600819199, "month_true_total": 127, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:59:11 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "76401810", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079323277", "personaname": "Bruce Force", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079323277/", "num_games_owned": 147, "num_reviews": 95, "playtime_forever": 1052, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 568, "last_played": 1601155235, "avatar": "74a4af309be17aa7c1138287a3d0c5301d10cddd"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is a simple game with simple game mechanics. The single player campaign is short and while there is a story, it does not exactly provide in-depth knowledge on the Warhammer 40k universe. The campaign took me slightly more than 7h on normal difficulty to finish - there is not much replayability, and with hunting for additional achievements I got almost all single player achievements after about 9.5h. So yeah, it is really short.\n\nNevertheless, it is a fun game, if you like casual mayhem, Warhammer badassery, and smashing large groups of enemies. It doesn't take long to get into it, no long tutorials to get though, and you figure everything out as you go. But if you are looking for advanced game play mechanics, character progression, and an involved story, then this game is not for you.", "timestamp_created": 1600815526, "timestamp_updated": 1600815526, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76381662", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067419369", "personaname": "Speed Humps", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067419369/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 117, "last_played": 1732074837, "avatar": "d5ff90ae073ba5e89555debf1f6db98c589e0371"}, "language": "english", "review": "awesome game, satisfyingly gory, makes to feel like you are an ultramarine champion.", "timestamp_created": 1600786449, "timestamp_updated": 1600786449, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76375689", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090032114", "personaname": "master wu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090032114/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 5279, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5204, "last_played": 1635998870, "avatar": "407120e0e7020ea004b6fb202c06d26b5c1cb033"}, "language": "english", "review": "This my fellow gamers is a very good game despite being a little dated definatly worth the measly asking price plenty of people still playing multiplayer. Pick this game up to add to your stash. Multi player is fun as hell slugging it out with your battle brothers. You wont find a better game for the price do yourself a favour and pick up space marine and perhaps i will bleed with you on the field of battle my brother.", "timestamp_created": 1600777713, "timestamp_updated": 1600777713, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendat